// Generic, hero-agnostic marker - presence means this entity has some real source of applying Burn
// to enemies (an Ascension pick, not just the baseline weapon-elemental-proc roll). Granted once by
// every Burn-granting Ascension (Max's Ignition rank 1, Burning Vengeance rank 1, Vendetta Strike
// rank 1) and never removed - once true, permanently true, a simple no-un-grant-path tag. Read by
// FlashpointPassiveUpgradeData.IsEligible so Flashpoint isn't offered in the draft until Max actually
// has a Burn source to make it matter - see docs/max-ascensions.md's own "Burn Ascension Eligibility"
// section. Deliberately a lightweight concrete tag rather than a fully generic status-keyed
// eligibility registry this codebase has no other consumer for yet - reusable by any future hero's
// own Burn (or other status) prerequisite the same way.
component CanApplyBurn
{
}
